## q04-pier9-vendor-split

**[MISSING-VARIANT]** Fact 2 alias `gangway vendor` does not appear verbatim (after lowercasing) in any raw artifact. Raw uses `p9-gang vendor`, not `gangway vendor`.

> R06: "**Bridgeway Hoist** owns the **gangway replacement** scope as **p9-gang vendor**."

**[BAD-ALIAS]** Fact 1 alias `gate vendor` appears only in a delivery-delay aside, not in the vendor-assignment lines that answer the query.

> R25: "Gate vendor delay does NOT push gangway — different hoist contract, different berth window."

**[NODE-MISSING-ANCHOR]** Expected node `bridgeway-hoist` foregrounds `gangway vendor` in its model text, but its evidence block quotes only `p9-gang vendor` from raw — the listed alias `gangway vendor` is not anchored there.

