## q05-kelwick-superseded

**[MISSING-VARIANT]** Fact 1 aliases `single contractor plan` and `pier 9 single contractor` are absent from raw artifacts. Raw consistently uses hyphenated forms only.

> R13: "retired the **pier 9 single-contractor** envelope" / "old **single-contractor plan** for audit trail only"  
> (No raw line contains `single contractor plan` or `pier 9 single contractor` without hyphens.)

**[NODE-MISSING-ANCHOR]** Expected node `plan-pier9-single-contractor` evidence line misquotes R13 with an unhyphenated form that is not in the artifact:

> Graph evidence claims: "old **single contractor plan** for audit trail"  
> R13 actual: "**Kelwick Marine** remains named on the old **single-contractor plan** for audit trail only"

